    "5. Run compile_workflow_to_graph() and verify no errors",
    "6. For prompt tests, run pt2lg plan --prompt and verify JSON plan structure",
    "7. For json_plan tests, run json_plan_to_workflow_spec() and validate",
    "8. For negative tests, verify expected error codes and messages"
